OL,3,GNEWSATalks over university job cuts
OL,4,Abreak down after union official
OL,5,Adismissed
OL,6,
OL,7,FTalks in an ongoing dispute over
OL,8,Fplanned job cuts at the University of
OL,9,FAberdeen have broken down after a
OL,10,Fsenior trade union official was
OL,11,Fdismissed, BBC Scotland has learned.
OL,13,FA #10m savings plan - which could see
OL,14,Fmore than 100 jobs lost - was agreed
OL,15,Fearlier this year.
OL,17,FThe University and College Union (UCU)
OL,18,Fsaid the staff member's dismissal
OL,19,Fneeded to be met with a "proportionate
OL,20,Fresponse", and that it had withdrawn
OL,21,Ffrom the ongoing negotiations.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
